    <protocol>Run through task-execute. Fresh branch from origin/master in a short-path worktree (C:\wt214); PR to master.</protocol>
  </execution>
  <completion>Done 2026-11-25: PR #3116 squash-merged to master (96eb90403f, Closes #2774) after a main-session review. The Sent Items lookup filters sentDateTime ge (send start minus 2 min) and subject, ordered by sentDateTime desc, top 3, on both the Me and Users paths, so Graph no longer answers 400 and the Internet-Message-Id reaches reply matching and the archive. 15 new tests (6 failed on master); publish +620 B. Dev check after the next uac-r2 dev BFF build: the sentitems GET returns 2xx.</completion>
</task>
